</figure>
<div id="A2.SS1.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p4.1" class="ltx_p">To train our models, we employed a cosine learning rate scheduler, which included a warmup phase constituting 10% of the total training steps. This is a standard and effective technique in LLM optimization <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib20" title="" class="ltx_ref">Loshchilov and
Hutter (2017)</a></cite>. For all models, we configured a per-device batch size of 2 and used gradient accumulation over 16 steps. This resulted in a global batch size of 128. The training for all three preference optimization objectives (MMPO, DPO, and SimPO) was conducted on four L40 GPUs, leveraging the DeepSpeed Stage 2 optimizer for efficient multi-GPU training <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rasley et al. (2020)</a></cite>. We set the maximum prompt length to 1800 tokens and the maximum completion length to 512 tokens consistently across all models and objectives. For preference optimization with the Llama3-8B model, we used four H100 GPUs.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p5.1" class="ltx_p">For the SmolLM2 models (135M and 360M parameters), we trained all parameters using the AdamW optimizer <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">Loshchilov and
Hutter (2019)</a></cite>. In contrast, for the Llama3.2-1B model, we utilized Low-Rank Adaptation (LoRA) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Hu et al. (2021)</a></cite> on the attention and feedforward projection matrices. For the Llama3-8B model, we applied LoRA adaptation only on the attention projection matrices. For both Llama models, the LoRA configuration consisted of a rank (<math id="A2.SS1.p5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>r</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r</annotation></semantics></math>) of 64, an alpha (<math id="A2.SS1.p5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>) of 64, and a dropout rate of 0.01. The LoRA parameters were optimized using the 8-bit Adam optimizer to enhance memory efficiency <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">Dettmers et al. (2022)</a></cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS1.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS1.p6.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A2.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ B.1 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix B Experiments ‣ Offline Preference Optimization via Maximum Marginal Likelihood Estimation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> summarizes the tuned hyperparameters across all the models and objectives.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.2 </span>Entropy Gradient Approximation</h3>

<div id="A2.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To compute the gradient of the entropy objective with respect to the parameters <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>, we use the following gradient approximation. We consider a mini-batch of <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|B|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|B|</annotation></semantics></math> text completions <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>. Each sample has a maximum sequence length of <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> tokens. For simplicity, we consider padding all different sequences in the batch up to this maximum length <math id="A2.SS2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>T</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T</annotation></semantics></math> while using a mask vector to cancel the effect of pad tokens.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.E10" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E10X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E10X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)=\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}+\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>β</mi><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)=\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}+\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(10)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E10Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E10Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z^{(i)}_{&lt;t}\mid x)\;H\!\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mpadded style="width:0.742em;" width="0.742em"><mi>H</mi></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z^{(i)}_{&lt;t}\mid x)\;H\!\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E10Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E10Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}H\!\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mpadded style="width:0.742em;" width="0.742em"><mi>H</mi></mpadded><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}H\!\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS2.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Proof.</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">We first show that the entropy objective can be rewritten in terms of the per-step entropies in the following equation:</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p5" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.E11" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E11X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{z}\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)\log\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{z}\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)\log\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="5" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(11)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E11Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{z}\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{t}\mid z_{&lt;t},x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{z}\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)\sum_{t=1}^{T}\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{t}\mid z_{&lt;t},x)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E11Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z}\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{t}\mid z_{&lt;t},x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>z</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z}\pi_{\theta}(z\mid x)\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{t}\mid z_{&lt;t},x)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E11Xc" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11Xc.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{1:t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{1:t}\mid x)\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{t}\mid z_{&lt;t},x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>t</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=-\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{1:t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{1:t}\mid x)\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{t}\mid z_{&lt;t},x)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E11Xd" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E11Xd.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p6" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p6.1" class="ltx_p">We can have the following approximation for the gradient vector of the entropy with respect to the parameter set <math id="A2.SS2.p6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>:</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p7" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.E12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E12X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)=\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}+\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>β</mi><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)=\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}+\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(12)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E12Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}=\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\nabla_{\theta}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}=\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\nabla_{\theta}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E12Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E12Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}=\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)\nabla_{\theta}H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}=\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)\nabla_{\theta}H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p8" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p8.1" class="ltx_p">By using the score-function identity:</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p9" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p9.1" class="ltx_p"><math id="A2.SS2.p9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\theta}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)=\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\theta}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)=\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)</annotation></semantics></math>,
we have <math id="A2.SS2.p9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}=" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mphantom></mphantom></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}=</annotation></semantics></math></p>
<table id="A2.E13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E13X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E13X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></msub><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo rspace="0.167em" stretchy="false">)</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\beta\sum_{t=1}^{T}\sum_{z_{&lt;t}}\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z_{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(13)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p10" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p10.1" class="ltx_p">By using the samples <math id="A2.SS2.p10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z^{(i)}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>z</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z^{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math> in the mini-batch to approximate the prefix sample expectations, we have our final approximation:</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p11" class="ltx_para">
<table id="A2.E14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A2.E14X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)=\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}+\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>β</mi><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}\beta H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid x)\big)=\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}+\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(14)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E14Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z^{(i)}{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{1}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}\log\pi_{\theta}(z^{(i)}{&lt;t}\mid x)H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.E14Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E14Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}_{&lt;t},x)\big)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>P</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≈</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>β</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>T</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0.167em">∇</mo><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi>H</mi><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">(</mo><mi>π</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>z</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo><mo maxsize="1.200em" minsize="1.200em">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\nabla_{\theta}P_{2}\approx\frac{\beta}{|B|}\sum^{|B|}_{i=1}\sum_{t=1}^{T}\nabla_{\theta}H\big(\pi_{\theta}(\cdot\mid z^{(i)}_{&lt;t},x)\big)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.SS2.p12" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS2.p12.1" class="ltx_p">This finishes our proof.
 <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:5.7pt;height:5.7pt;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></p>
</div>
